  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund to Support the Roma Education Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objective of the multi-donor trust find is to support the operation  of the Roma Education Fund (REF, an NGO), and its objectives to  improve the education attainment of Roma children and reduce  disparities with non-Roma populations in Europe.  Specifically the REF  has three objectives the MDTF will contribute to:
 1.	Reducing the educational gap between Roma and non-Roma children by  providing better access to quality education.
 2.	Promoting Roma inclusion in all aspects of the national education  systems, especially in countries participating in the Decade of Roma  Inclusion.
 3.	Combating segregation of Roma children in education systems.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
